- 0x0: DAC1 outputs CVBS video (SDATE);
- 0x1: DAC1 outputs standard-definition analog video Y/R component (SDATE);
- 0x2: DAC1 outputs standard-definition analog video Cb/G component (SDATE);
- 0x3: DAC1 outputs standard-definition analog video Cr/B component (SDATE);
- 0x4: DAC1 outputs high-definition analog video Y/R component (HDATE);
- 0x5: DAC1 outputs high-definition analog video Cb/G component (HDATE);
- 0x6: DAC1 outputs high-definition analog video Cr/B component (HDATE);
- 0x7: DAC1 outputs VGA video R component;
- 0x8: DAC1 outputs VGA video G component;
- 0x9: DAC1 outputs VGA video B component.";
